{"id":"wb-7-514","name":"阔纳齐兰遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"阔纳齐兰遗址","text":"阔纳齐兰遗址，即齐兰古城、阔纳齐兰旧址，是位于中国新疆维吾尔自治区阿克苏地区柯坪县的清代台站遗址，是清代阿克苏与喀什噶尔之间重要的交通驿站。阔纳齐兰遗址始建于道光八年（1826年），于20世纪初遭弃。遗址是南疆地区保持较好、规模较大的清代古遗址，现为全国重点文物保护单位。\n阔纳齐兰遗址之“阔纳”源自维吾尔语阔纳先尔（维吾尔语：كونا شەھەر，罗马化：kona sheher，为古城之意）。以阔纳齐兰遗址为核心建设有国家AAAA级旅游景区，齐兰古城景区。阔纳齐兰遗址现存驿站及住宅建筑群等遗迹。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%98%94%E7%BA%B3%E9%BD%90%E5%85%B0%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":95407894,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95407894","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1603ba4249f07c906b07c5fe.jpg","title":"阔纳齐兰遗址.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%98%94%E7%BA%B3%E9%BD%90%E5%85%B0%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/03/%E9%98%94%E7%BA%B3%E9%BD%90%E5%85%B0%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​阔纳齐兰遗址","width":320,"height":180}}